              'Prepare the Google Sheet “Zapier Practice” once: tabs Enquiries (headings enquiry_id, received, channel, customer_name, customer_email, message, with E01 in row 2) and Log (headings logged_at, enquiry_id, ai_output, approved_reply, decision, owner). Share it as view only with Anyone with the link. Test the copy from a second account.',
              'Send the link and the page “Before Session 6 (15 minutes)” at least two days before. Learners create a Google account and a Zapier account, must not start the trial, and copy the sheet with File, Make a copy.',
