        questions=[('Why is the notify address typed by hand?', 'If the customer’s address came from the data, the Zap would email the customer and the approval step would protect no one.'),
                   ('Why does the filter sit after the approval and not before it?', 'It reads the approval result, which does not exist until the person has answered. It also reads the AI note for FLAG.'),
                   ('What do you do if the Zap starts many times?', 'Turn it off at once, check the run history and the usage page, delete the extra rows, and turn it on again with one row.')],
